---
import { Bot, FileSearch, Library } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="tool-recipes" aria-labelledby="tool-recipes-title">
  <div class="section-heading compact">
    <span class="section-kicker">工具配方</span>
    <h2 id="tool-recipes-title">同一方法，換工具也能做</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="tabs" data-tabs>
    <div role="tablist" aria-label="工具配方">
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-web" aria-controls="panel-web" aria-selected="true"><Bot size={17} aria-hidden="true" />網頁 AI</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-notebook" aria-controls="panel-notebook" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><Library size={17} aria-hidden="true" />NotebookLM</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-agent" aria-controls="panel-agent" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><FileSearch size={17} aria-hidden="true" />檔案型 Agent</button>
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-web" aria-labelledby="tab-web">
      <strong>適合先釐清問題與輸出格式。</strong>
      <p>只提供完成當前判斷所需的材料，要求模型分開列出證據、推論與尚待確認的內容。</p>
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-notebook" aria-labelledby="tab-notebook" hidden>
      <strong>NotebookLM 適合有固定來源的閱讀與對照。</strong>
      <p>建立專題筆記本、限定授權來源，產生摘要後回到原文位置核對，不把引用標記當成內容正確的保證。</p>
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-agent" aria-labelledby="tab-agent" hidden>
      <strong>適合跨檔案整理、產生差異與執行驗證。</strong>
      <p>先讓 agent 閱讀工作區並列出計畫，不修改檔案，再授權小範圍修改；完成後查看 diff、執行檢查並保存證據。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-tabs]').forEach((tabs) => {
    const tabList = Array.from(tabs.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[role="tab"]'));
    const selectTab = (next: HTMLButtonElement) => {
      tabList.forEach((tab) => {
        const selected = tab === next;
        tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(selected));
        tab.tabIndex = selected ? 0 : -1;
        const panel = tabs.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`#${tab.getAttribute('aria-controls')}`);
        if (panel) panel.hidden = !selected;
      });
    };
    tabList.forEach((tab, index) => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => selectTab(tab));
      tab.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') selectTab(tab);
        if (event.key === 'ArrowRight' || event.key === 'ArrowLeft') {
          event.preventDefault();
          const offset = event.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : -1;
          const next = tabList[(index + offset + tabList.length) % tabList.length];
          selectTab(next);
          next.focus();
        }
      });
    });
  });
</script>
